  "description": "Discover the magic of easy watercolor painting in the digital realm with our Procreate 2023 Watercolor Brushes. Craft your masterpiece with precision using these versatile watercolor brushes, specially designed for Procreate. Create lifelike watercolor textures and effects on digital paper with the ease of Procreate 2023. Whether you’re new to digital watercolor or a seasoned artist, our Procreate Watercolor Brushes will transform your artwork into a beautiful watercolor masterpiece.\nINCLUDED\n* 5 watercolor brushes | .BRUSHSET file\n* Watercolor Paper for painting 4000×3000px | 300 DPI | .PROCREATE file\n* color palette | .SWATCHES file\nREQUIREMENTS:\n* Procreate App\n* Apple Pencil\n* iPad Pro\nINSTALLATION:\n✅ Make sure your iOS is updated and you have the latest version of Procreate App: Procreate 5 and higher. The brushes only work in the Procreate app. They do not work in any other apps.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Discover the magic of easy watercolor painting in the digital realm with our Procreate 2023 Watercolor Brushes. Craft your masterpiece with precision using these versatile watercolor brushes, specially designed for Procreate. Create lifelike watercolor textures and effects on digital paper with the ease of Procreate 2023. Whether you’re new to digital watercolor or a seasoned artist, our Procreate Watercolor Brushes will transform your artwork into a beautiful watercolor masterpiece.</p>\n<p>INCLUDED</p>\n<p>* 5 watercolor brushes | .BRUSHSET file<br>\n* Watercolor Paper for painting 4000×3000px | 300 DPI | .PROCREATE file<br>\n* color palette | .SWATCHES file</p>\n<p>REQUIREMENTS:<br>\n* Procreate App<br>\n* Apple Pencil<br>\n* iPad Pro</p>\n<p>INSTALLATION:</p>\n<p>✅ Make sure your iOS is updated and you have the latest version of Procreate App: Procreate 5 and higher. The brushes only work in the Procreate app. They do not work in any other apps.</p>",
